  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">First Join Message 是一款極簡風格且可自訂配置的模組，會在玩家首次加入世界時發送訊息。這可用於創造更具沉浸感的首次體驗，或提供資訊性的提示，例如伺服器規則或小遊戲說明。此外還可設定當新玩家加入時向整個伺服器廣播訊息。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s 自訂化套件\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>firstJoinMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"你醒來在一個陌生的地方。\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家首次加入世界時收到的訊息。若要停用，請留空。可使用 %s 取代玩家名稱。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>firstJoinMessageTextFormattingColourIndex</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 2, min 0, max 15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;訊息的顏色。所選數值可為下方任一選項。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>serverBroadcastMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家首次加入世界時收到的廣播訊息。若要停用，請留空。可使用 %s 取代玩家名稱。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>serverBroadcastMessageTextFormattingColourIndex</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 3, min 0, max 15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;訊息的顏色。所選數值可為下方任一選項。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>設定檔中可用的 TextFormatting.Colour 值：</strong></span><br><em>0: black,</em><br><em>1: dark_blue,</em><br><em>2: dark_green,</em><br><em>3: dark_aqua,</em><br><em>4: dark_red,</em><br><em>5: dark_purple,</em><br><em>6: gold, </em><br><em>7: gray, </em><br><em>8: dark_gray, </em><br><em>9: blue, </em><br><em>10: green, </em><br><em>11: aqua, </em><br><em>12: red, </em><br><em>13: light_purple, </em><br><em>14: yellow, </em><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>15: white.</em></span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>遊戲內的預設訊息：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/first-join-message/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"631\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論功能已關閉，因為我無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤回覆。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 存放庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
